description_of_intervention:
The experimental plan followed a pair block design in which a single wheat field (>2 ha) per farm was considered as a block with two strategies (Figure 1):
i. FA, with flowering plants sown adjacent to a margin of the wheat field;
ii. control, in the opposite side of the wheat field, which was characterized by wild plants growing spontaneously in the field margin.

